# Native Capacitor project — regenerated fresh by the GitHub Actions build
# (see .github/workflows/build-apk.yml). Not committed so there's nothing
# native to keep in sync by hand; if you later want to customize the native
# project (custom icon, splash screen, permissions) run `npx cap add android`
# locally, commit android/, and switch the workflow to `cap sync` instead.
